      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, and fixed in patch set 2. Every sub-type other than STEP1 fell through to the merge path, so an extension of the protocol -- or a malformed frame -- would have been handed to the engine as if it were an update.\n\nSTEP2 and UPDATE are now matched explicitly and anything else is ignored with a warning.",
